    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p1-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "AND UPON reviewing all other relevant case documents filed in this matter",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p1-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "IT IS HEREBY ORDERED THAT:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p1-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "1. The Application is dismissed.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p1-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "2. The Claimant shall bear its own costs of the Application.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Issued by:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Hayley Norton",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Assistant Registrar",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b4",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Date of issue: 23 January 2026",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b5",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "At: 3pm",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b6",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "SCHEDULE OF REASONS",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b7",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "1. On 19 November 2025, the Claimant filed Application No. CFl-010-2024/7 seeking the issuance of a",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b8",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Default Costs Certificate (the \"Application\").",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b9",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "2. The Application states that the Claimant intends to apply for an order that:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b10",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "\"The DIFC Courts issue a Default Costs Certificate pursuant to Rule 40.17 of the Rules of the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b11",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "DIFC Courts in respect of the Bill of Costs served on 16 October 2025, no Points of Dispute",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b12",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "having been served within the time prescribed by RDC 40.15.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b13",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "because",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b14",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "The Defendant failed to serve Points of Dispute within 21 days of service of the Claimant's Bill of",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b15",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Costs dated 16 October 2025. The Claimant is therefore entitled to a Default Costs Certificate",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "quantifying the recoverable costs as set out in the Detailed Professional Fees and Disbursements",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "previously filed and served.\"",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(emphasis added)",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "3. In support of the Application, the Claimant relies on the witness statement of Nasir Hakim Salman",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b20",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Basheer, dated 7 November 2025. It is said therein that, on 16 October 2025, the Claimant served",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b21",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "upon the Defendant's legal representatives, the following documents:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b22",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "\"(a) the Notice of Commencement of Detailed Assessment (Form P40/01);",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b23",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(b) the Schedule of Detailed Professional Fees;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b24",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(c) the Schedule of Disbursements with invoices; and",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b25",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(d) the cover letter entitled \"Detailed Professional Fees and",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b26",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Disbursements - CFI-010-2024'\".",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b27",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "4. Having reviewed the Court file, I find that the Claimant has failed to comply with the procedural",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b28",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "requirements set out in Rule 40.5 of the Rules of the DIFC Courts (\"RDC\"). RDC 40.5 requires that",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b29",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "detailed assessment proceedings be commenced by the receiving party serving on the paying party",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b30",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "both (i) a Notice of Commencement in Form P40/01; and (ii) a copy of the bill of costs.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b31",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "5. RDC 40.5 is clear that a request for detailed assessment proceedings must be made by way of a",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b32",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "specific procedure, namely, using Form P4o/01 and paying the associated filing fee, and not by way of",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p2-b33",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "a general P23 Application Notice.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p3-b1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "6. As the Claimant has failed to comply with the mandatory procedural requirements for commencing",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p3-b2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "detailed assessment proceedings, it is not entitled to rely upon RDC 40.15 and 40.17 for the issuance",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p3-b3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "of a Default Costs Certificate.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p3-b4",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "7. Accordingly, the Application must be dismissed, and the Claimant shall bear its own costs of the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "443e04bc1a78940b3fcd5438d24b6c5f182a276d354a3108e738b193675de032-p3-b5",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "Application.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    }
  ],
  "tables": []
}
